                <p class="card-link-copy">Yes. Upload any inspection or checklist form and Quickler builds it into a WhatsApp workflow, whether it is electrical, fire safety, plumbing, fleet or a site walk. Browse the <a href="/pages/services.html">workflows</a> to see the range.</p>
            </article>
